item.description:
XSS 真的越學越好玩 q(≧▽≦q)
但學不動了，又捲又菜的捲心胡桃菜&hellip;
速查 BurpSuite XSS 全姿勢: https://portswigger.net/web-security/cross-site-scripting/cheat-sheet Prototype Pollution （一種覆蓋掉 JS 物件屬性內容的攻擊）: BlackFan/client-side-prototype-pollution CSP Bypass: https://cspbypass.com/ XSLeak WIKI: https://xsleaks.dev/ CURE53 GOD html5sec: https://html5sec.org/ BurpSuite 插件很適合拿來快速找！ 還沒念的文章 qq https://mizu.re/post/exploring-the-dompurify-library-bypasses-and-fixes https://blog.pspaul.de/posts/bench-press-leaking-text-nodes-with-css/ https://buer.haus/2024/02/23/go-go-xss-gadgets-chaining-a-dom-clobbering-exploit-in-the-wild/ https://sudistark.github.io/2024/08/31/bypassing-csp-via-url-parser-confusions-xss-on-netlify-s-image-cdn.html 好像是字體相關的 bug (link) Trusted Types: https://web.dev/articles/trusted-types?hl=zh-tw Lab Intigriti XSS Challenges: https://www.intigriti.com/researchers/hackademy/xss-challenges Huli Writeup https://blog.huli.tw/
